    [OHOS ERROR] [NINJA]                                       ^
    [OHOS ERROR] [NINJA] /data/android12/ohos-rpi4-5.0.1/sources/out/kernel/src_tmp/linux-5.10/arch/arm64/kvm/mmio.c:83:25: error: use of undeclared identifier 'EXCEPT_AA32_IABT'
    [OHOS ERROR] [NINJA]                 case unpack_vcpu_flag(EXCEPT_AA32_IABT):
    [OHOS ERROR] [NINJA]                                       ^
    [OHOS ERROR] [NINJA] /data/android12/ohos-rpi4-5.0.1/sources/out/kernel/src_tmp/linux-5.10/arch/arm64/kvm/mmio.c:84:25: error: use of undeclared identifier 'EXCEPT_AA32_DABT'
