    [OHOS ERROR] [NINJA]                 switch (vcpu_get_flag(vcpu, EXCEPT_MASK)) {
    [OHOS ERROR] [NINJA]                                             ^
    [OHOS ERROR] [NINJA] /data/android12/ohos-rpi4-5.0.1/sources/out/kernel/src_tmp/linux-5.10/arch/arm64/kvm/mmio.c:91:8: error: implicit declaration of function 'unpack_vcpu_flag' [-Werror,-Wimplicit-function-declaration]
    [OHOS ERROR] [NINJA]                 case unpack_vcpu_flag(EXCEPT_AA64_EL1_SYNC):
    [OHOS ERROR] [NINJA]                      ^
